    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24018250416128
    m_Localized: 'You discard <b>all</b> of your cards in your hand to the <b>deck</b>
      except for one.It goes to the <b>graveyard</b>.

      In exchange, you <b>draw
      one fewer</b> but greater than zero cards <b>into your hand</b>.'
